  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"></p>\r\n<p data-end=\"413\" data-start=\"117\"><strong data-end=\"140\" data-start=\"117\">Brand Introduction:</strong><br data-end=\"143\" data-start=\"140\">We are <strong data-end=\"164\" data-start=\"150\">Quote Plug</strong>, a movement disguised as a streetwear brand. Our designs speak to those who feel trapped by the illusions of modern society&mdash;those who see through the noise and crave something real. We aren&rsquo;t here to dress the masses. We exist for the awakened few..</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"692\" data-start=\"415\"><strong data-end=\"439\" data-start=\"415\">Product Description:</strong><br data-end=\"442\" data-start=\"439\">Dark, rebellious, and purpose-driven streetwear: high-quality DTG-printed tees, hoodies, and caps with bold, cryptic statements that hit harder the more you think about them. Every piece is a visual protest against control, deception, and conformity.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"981\" data-start=\"694\"><strong data-end=\"725\" data-start=\"694\">Unique Selling Point:</strong><br data-end=\"728\" data-start=\"725\">Our clothing isn&rsquo;t just for style&mdash;it&rsquo;s a signal. A symbol that the wearer questions the narrative and stands for truth in a world built on distraction. Designs are raw, real, and instantly recognizable.<br data-end=\"933\" data-start=\"930\"><em data-end=\"981\" data-start=\"933\">\"Everyone can put it on. Not all can wear it.\"</em></p>\r\n<p data-end=\"1171\" data-start=\"983\"><strong data-end=\"1001\" data-start=\"983\">Payment Terms:</strong><br data-end=\"1004\" data-start=\"1001\">10% commission per sale<br data-end=\"1033\" data-start=\"1030\">Payouts monthly<br data-end=\"1118\" data-start=\"1115\">No refunds,&nbsp; just real payouts for real sales</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"1444\" data-start=\"1173\"><strong data-end=\"1195\" data-start=\"1173\">Other Information:</strong><br data-end=\"1198\" data-start=\"1195\">We&rsquo;re selective. We want creators who <strong data-end=\"1246\" data-start=\"1236\">get it</strong>&mdash;those with an edge, a voice, and a style that doesn&rsquo;t just follow trends, but bends them. If your content calls out the lies, exposes the system, or pushes people to think deeper, you&rsquo;re one of us.</p>",
